            <description><![CDATA[<p><em>Gentler lead-in to breaks, reliable session time</em></p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul><li>Soft tone shortly before the break — can be switched off</li><li>Countdown two minutes before the 5-minute break, with notice</li></ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul><li>5-minute break: screen-free first, stretch only on request</li><li>Bilateral tapping off by default</li></ul>
<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul><li>Session time recognises a lunch break with the lid closed</li><li>“Cancel” no longer resets the session time</li><li>Display sleeps and locks after an unanswered break</li></ul>
]]></description>
